evice itself.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Direct Control:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: x-large;"&gt;N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Local Control:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5"&gt;DigitalWrite HIGH on D0 for ON, LOW for OFF.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Remote Control:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5"&gt;N/A&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: x-large;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Data Specifications:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5"&gt;Message Format: [level]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5"&gt;level: a positive number&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5"&gt;Analog Output: A0.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Example:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: 'Courier New';"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: x-large;"&gt;Observe pressure value on the sensor's display. As a reminder the pressure value is assumed to be between P_MIN and P_MAX (see&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;main.js&lt;/i&gt;). If the range of changes in pressure values of the environment is different from what the above values are set by default, they will need to be adjusted accordingly in order to produce correct analog outputs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br class="Apple-interchange-newline"&gt;&lt;!--EndFragment--&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</SPECIFICATIONS>
